nixio
------------------------------------------
C++ library for storing scientific data in the NIX data model.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.4.10-1
  libboost_filesystem1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_program_options1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_regex1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_system1.66-1.66.0-1
  libgcc1-11.4.0-1
  libhdf5_200-1.12.2-1
  libnixio-devel-1.5.0+git20230213-1bl1
  libnixio1-1.5.0+git20230213-1bl1
  libstdc++6-11.4.0-1
  pkg-config-2.1.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.41-3
  cmake-3.25.3-1
  cygport-0.36.7-1
  gcc-core-11.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-11.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libhdf5-devel-1.12.2-1
  ninja-1.11.1-1

Canonical website:
  https://g-node.github.io/nixio/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/G-Node/nixio/archive/1.5.0+git20230213.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnixio1-1.5.0+git20230213-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnixio-devel-1.5.0+git20230213-X.tar.xz

